*> Data items that nothing refers to.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  USED-FIELD          PIC X.
01  UNUSED-FIELD        PIC X.
01  PARTLY-USED.
    05  USED-MEMBER     PIC X.
    05  UNUSED-MEMBER   PIC X.
    05  UNUSED-GROUP.
        10  DEEP-1      PIC X.
        10  DEEP-2      PIC X.
01  USED-AS-GROUP.
    05  MEMBER-A        PIC X.
    05  MEMBER-B        PIC X.
01  SWITCHES.
    05  EOF-SWITCH      PIC X.
        88  AT-EOF      VALUE "Y".
01  TABLE-SIZE          PIC 9(4).
01  THE-TABLE.
    05  ROW             PIC X OCCURS 1 TO 10 DEPENDING ON TABLE-SIZE.
01  SHARED-ITEM         PIC X EXTERNAL.
01  DAY-NAMES-VALUES.
    05  FILLER          PIC X(3) VALUE "MON".
    05  FILLER          PIC X(3) VALUE "TUE".
01  DAY-NAMES REDEFINES DAY-NAMES-VALUES.
    05  DAY-NAME        PIC X(3) OCCURS 2 TIMES.
01  UNUSED-VIEW REDEFINES DAY-NAMES-VALUES PIC X(6).
78  UNUSED-CONSTANT     VALUE 10.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01  UNUSED-LOCAL        PIC X.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  UNUSED-PARAMETER    PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "A" TO USED-FIELD USED-MEMBER
    MOVE SPACES TO USED-AS-GROUP
    IF AT-EOF DISPLAY ROW(1) DAY-NAME(1) END-IF
    STOP RUN.
